6s5|v|To beat, as with a club or cudgel; to treat with violence; to handle roughly. ; To beat or thump, or to cause ( something) to hit or strike against another object, in such a way as to make a loud noise; as, to bang a drum or a piano; to bang a door (against the doorpost or casing) in shutting it. ; To make a loud noise, as if with a blow or succession of blows; as, the window blind banged and waked me; he was banging on the piano. ; To cut squarely across, as the tail of a hors, or the forelock of human beings; to cut (the hair).	o:6s5,92,1~6s5,92,1	s:8an,36,2~8an,36,2	D:6s5,92,1~6s5,92,1
